      "title": "The Last Light in Platform Nine",
      "body": "The district blackout reaches the tram depot before the evacuation order does. Emergency strips burn red along the floor. A maintenance courier lies conscious beside a dead relay case, too injured to carry it farther. Tamsin, a systems apprentice, is trying to keep the depot doors powered long enough for the remaining passengers to leave.",
